g wallpaper #108 to be used in an ",["l","孵化器","incubator"]," in place of a ",["l","恐龙蛋","Dinosaur Egg"],". Fixed bug allowing wallpaper #75 to be used in place of a ",["l","五彩碎片","Prismatic Shard"]," to obtain the ",["l","银河剑","Galaxy Sword"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Added 26 new wallpaper styles, most of which are not available in the ",["l","目录","Catalogue"],". Price at Pierre's increased from 100g to 200g. Pierre's and JojaMart now sell the same random wallpaper on the same day instead of one day apart."]]]]]]]}